{
  "body" : "Create a vertical 4:5 black-and-white cinematic film portrait.\n\nIf a user reference photo is provided, use it as Image A for the main subject: preserve the person's identity, face shape, facial structure, hairstyle, age impression, natural expression, and recognizable features. Transform the person into the cinematic black-and-white scene; do not replace the face, do not beautify into a generic AI face, and do not change the person's identity. If no reference photo is provided, use the text description below.\n\n【Main subject】\nAdult person, {{main_subject_description}}, wearing {{outfit}}.\n\n【Second figure】\nAdult secondary figure, {{second_figure}}, wearing dark clothing. This figure should act as an emotional presence, not a clear second main subject.\n\n【Scene】\n{{scene}}, minimal background, low-contrast grayscale, mist, wind, film grain, and emotional tension.\n\nVery important: use layered focus, not global blur.\n\nThe main subject’s face center must stay relatively readable, especially the eyes, nose bridge, lips, and facial center line. If a reference photo is provided, these readable facial details must still resemble the person in Image A.\n\nMotion blur should appear only on the hair, hair ends, coat edges, shoulders, moving outlines, and background streaks.\n\nThe secondary figure must be heavily defocused, blurred, or silhouette-like.\n\nMist, haze, rain, and softness should affect the foreground, background, and edges, but should not cover the main subject’s emotional expression.\n\nStyle:\nblack-and-white film photography, old film scan texture, visible grain, low-contrast grayscale, soft highlights, deep but detailed shadows, wind-dragged hair, slow-shutter motion blur, shallow depth of field, imperfect framing, arthouse cinema mood, emotional distance, unresolved relationship tension.\n\nAvoid:\nglobal soft focus, overly sharp commercial fashion photography, clean studio lighting, glossy advertising look, sweet couple photo, over-posed model expression, plastic skin, AI beauty face, colorful elements, text, logo.\n\nReference photo, if provided:\n{{reference_photo}}",
